{"title":"2012 COMC Problems/Problem A1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee87ec9b934e4c95fc45cea2c1313a611d992480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^4 = 4^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/3/eb36478224ec72858f9519f70214b3b54b391b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^b)^c = a^{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"22\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee87ec9b934e4c95fc45cea2c1313a611d992480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^4 = 4^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/c/16ce0b8a70099eaae98cfa3fb0062e011b1c994d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^3)^4 = (2^2)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d07810a87cad42e34cecd2f51c88359e43f5e07f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{12} = 2^{2n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>The bases are equal, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a837a867c7bd8bfef8cfaa3cf41fdeb6d8b4822e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f756f47dd71fa2b039db0cdc4141946663f9b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{12}{2} = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we know this, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/6588295b44ff6146f90102a75b6f71d1e2de7230.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^4 = 4096$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />. This is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c78734258d2d82aeb28c1631e8f1798154c888d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/e/b2ede056168db6213526bba3c865d011c706b29b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC\" title=\"2012 COMC\">2012 COMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Problem A2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_A2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem A2 (page does not exist)\">A2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_A3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem A3 (page does not exist)\">A3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_A4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem A4 (page does not exist)\">A4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_B1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem B1 (page does not exist)\">B1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_B2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem B2 (page does not exist)\">B2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_B3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem B3 (page does not exist)\">B3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_B4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem B4 (page does not exist)\">B4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_C1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem C1 (page does not exist)\">C1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_C2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem C2 (page does not exist)\">C2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_C3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem C3 (page does not exist)\">C3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_COMC_Problems/Problem_C4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 COMC Problems/Problem C4 (page does not exist)\">C4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Open_Mathematics_Challenge\" title=\"Canadian Open Mathematics Challenge\">Canadian Open Mathematics Challenge</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230757\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 90/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1225/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 79/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2000/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.233      1 Template:COMC_box\n100.00%   64.233      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36295:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230757 and revision id 281199. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}